OL,5,G0600 The Voice UK
OL,6,     FEmma Willis hosts the
OL,7,     Fspinning-chair singing contest,
OL,8,     Fwith coaches Tom Jones, Will.i.am,
OL,9,     FKelly Rowland, Tom Fletcher and
