OL,5,G1130 The Joy of Pets
OL,6,     FGaby Roslin and vet Bolu Eso are
OL,7,     Fin Birmingham celebrating the
OL,8,     Fextraordinary bond between people
OL,9,     Fand animals. At a specialist
OL,10,     Fveterinary hospital, Bolu follows
OL,11,     FLabrador Bobbie as he undergoes
OL,12,     Fpioneering laser surgery, while
OL,13,     Fanother dog presents the team with
OL,14,     Fa neurological mystery. Gaby
OL,15,     Flearns about StreetVet, the
OL,16,     Fcharity providing free veterinary
OL,17,     Fcare to the pets of people
OL,18,     Fexperiencing homelessness
